%S A402313 1,1,1,1,2,1,4,5,3,4,3,4,6,2,18,6,1,7,2,1,4,2,2,8,8,2,2,1,8,8,3,12
%N A402313 Narrow class numbers associated with terms of A094849.
%C A402313 a(n) is the narrow class number of the real quadratic field K = Q(sqrt(A094849(n))). This means that a(n) = A094850(n) if the fundamental unit of K has norm -1 and 2*A094850(n) if the fundamental unit of K has norm 1.
%H A402313 D. H. Lehmer, E. Lehmer and D. Shanks, <a href="/A002189/a002189.pdf">Integer sequences having prescribed quadratic character</a>, Math. Comp., 24 (1970), 433-451 [Annotated scanned copy].
%H A402313 <a href="/index/Qua#quadfield">Index entries for sequences related to quadratic fields</a>.
%Y A402313 Cf. A094847, A094849. See A399983 for a list of related sequences.
%K A402313 nonn,more,new
%O A402313 1,5
